{"type":"message","id":"60238010","parentId":"dfcf7c46","timestamp":"2026-06-03T07:33:20.875Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code (.ERROR_WORKER_CPU_TIME_EXCEEDED or .ERROR_WORKER_EXCEPTION). It seems the /send endpoint has a bug or is throwing an exception.\n\nLet me check if the API key for sending is different. The task description mentions `API_KEY: *** (first version) and `API_KEY: echo-a…key` (second version). Let me try the first one.\n\nActually, looking at the first message, it says `API_KEY: *** - this seems truncated. The second message has the full key `echo-agent-2026-secure-key`.\n\n\nBoth versions confirm the key is `echo-agent-2026-secure-key`, so the issue is likely the endpoint itself. Error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers indicates either CPU time limits exceeded or an unhandled exception, which could mean the Worker is crashing when processing POST requests. Let me check if there's a different endpoint I should be using instead.","thinkingSignature":"6a99197c0ec2e9c7a17f616fa3f7d62ed607f74e55c0c806a692742b0a691c0b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_z3h2r4mjuru0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check available endpoints\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/routes\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_z3h2r4mjuru0_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with a different POST body format\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d 'heartbeat test'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8035,"output":368,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22085,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":17804719934