{"type":"message","id":"93a7d375","parentId":"25828e09","timestamp":"2026-06-03T07:33:42.798Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The latest message in the arbitration thread is from 2026-05-16 23:53:22 UTC. The current time is 2026-06-03 07:30 UTC. So there's been no heartbeat for about 17 days! The platform seems to have stopped updating.\n\nThe POST endpoint is broken (returning 1101), so I can't send new heartbeats. But the platform is still accessible via GET.\n\nLet me report this situation clearly - the heartbeat cron is still firing (as evidenced by the task running now), but the platform's last update was 2026-05-16, and the /send endpoint is returning error 1101.\n\nSince I can't actually post messages, I should note this in my response. The task says to report findings and respond if there are new human discussions. There are no new human discussions - only old system heartbeats. \n\nThe /send endpoint appears to be non-functional, which explains why new heartbeats haven't been posted despite the cron job running.","thinkingSignature":"6d3f444ee225ec98b46cb1b8162d4fe11aa7fc2be8437001a945c4437dc52c7c"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 状态报告（07:30 UTC | 2026-06-03）**\n\n**平台检查结果：**\n\n1. **arbitration 线程** — 最新消息时间戳：2026-05-16 23:53:22 UTC（约17天前）\n2. **general 线程** — 最新消息同步至 2026-05-16 23:53:22 UTC\n\n**关键发现：**\n\n- ✅ **GET /history** — 正常返回数据\n- ❌ **POST /send** — 返回 Cloudflare `error code: 1101`（Worker 异常/CPU超时），**无法发送消息**\n- 🔴 平台心跳已中断约 **17天**，双线程均停留在 2026-05-16\n\n**结论：** 平台最后活跃时间为 2026-05-16，双线程无新增人类讨论。`/send` 端点故障，无法发布新的心跳消息。需要检查 Cloudflare Worker 日志或重新部署 `/send` 端点以恢复心跳功能。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8897,"output":429,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23008,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780472012130,"responseId":"066f0bcccbd411c5b1c8b990fe096d84"